WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:20.020
Ain't it just like the night
to play tricks when you're
tryin' to be so quiet?

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:30.263
We sit here stranded,
though we're all doin'
our best to deny it

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:40.507
And Louise holds a handful
of rain, temptin' you to defy it

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:48.381
Lights flicker from
the opposite loft

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:53.453
In this room the heat pipes
just cough

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:58.691
The country music station
plays soft

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:01.361
But there's nothing,
really nothing to turn off

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:11.638
Just Louise and her lover
so entwined

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:24.384
And these visions of Johanna
that conquer my mind

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:40.200
In the empty lot
where the ladies play

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:43.203
blindman's bluff
with the key chain

00:01:46.673 --> 00:01:49.843
And the all-night girls

00:01:49.843 --> 00:01:53.680
they whisper of escapades
out on the "D" train

00:01:56.983 --> 00:02:00.720
We can hear the night watchman
click his flashlight

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.857
Ask himself if it's him
or them that's insane

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:11.131
Louise, she's all right,
she's just near

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:16.769
She's delicate and
seems like the mirror

00:02:17.837 --> 00:02:21.808
But she just makes it all too
concise and too clear

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:23.810
That Johanna's not here

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:34.888
The ghost of 'lectricity howls
in the bones of her face

00:02:38.391 --> 00:02:48.001
Where these visions of Johanna
have now taken my place

00:02:59.279 --> 00:03:05.552
Now, little boy lost,
he takes himself so seriously

00:03:09.489 --> 00:03:15.628
He brags of his misery,
he likes to live dangerously

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:22.602
And when bringing her name up

00:03:22.602 --> 00:03:26.005
He speaks of a farewell
kiss to me

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:33.313
He's sure got a lotta gall

00:03:35.548 --> 00:03:38.251
to be so useless and all

00:03:40.687 --> 00:03:46.726
Muttering small talk at the wall
while I'm in the hall

00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:56.703
How can I explain?
It's so hard to get on

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:05.945
And these visions of Johanna,

00:04:05.945 --> 00:04:09.816
they kept me up past the dawn

00:04:20.693 --> 00:04:27.700
Inside the museums,
infinity goes up on trial

00:04:31.471 --> 00:04:38.011
Voices echo this is what
salvation must be like
after a while

00:04:41.547 --> 00:04:45.084
But Mona Lisa musta had
the highway blues

00:04:45.084 --> 00:04:47.754
You can tell by the way
she smiles

00:04:51.758 --> 00:04:55.728
See the primitive
wallflower freeze

00:04:57.163 --> 00:05:00.266
When the jelly-faced women
all sneeze

00:05:02.168 --> 00:05:08.074
Hear the one with the mustache
say, "Jeez, I can't find my
knees"

00:05:12.412 --> 00:05:18.484
Oh, jewels and binoculars
hang from the head of the mule

00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:31.531
But these visions of Johanna,
they make it all seem so cruel

00:05:42.742 --> 00:05:49.716
The peddler now speaks
to the countess who's
pretending to care for him

00:05:53.052 --> 00:06:00.159
Sayin', "Name me someone that's
not a parasite and I'll go out
and say a prayer for him"

00:06:03.062 --> 00:06:05.965
But like Louise always says

00:06:05.965 --> 00:06:07.834
"Ya can't look at much,
can ya man?"

00:06:07.834 --> 00:06:10.503
As she, herself,
prepares for him

00:06:13.439 --> 00:06:16.909
And Madonna,
she still has not showed

00:06:18.411 --> 00:06:22.315
We see this empty cage
now corrode

00:06:23.583 --> 00:06:27.620
Where her cape of the
stage once had flowed

00:06:28.688 --> 00:06:32.024
The fiddler,
he now steps to the road

00:06:33.326 --> 00:06:37.663
He writes ev'rything's been
returned which was owed

00:06:38.598 --> 00:06:42.301
On the back of the
fish truck that loads

00:06:42.301 --> 00:06:44.937
While my conscience explodes

00:06:48.141 --> 00:06:54.914
The harmonicas play
the skeleton keys and the rain

00:06:58.518 --> 00:07:07.093
And these visions of Johanna
are now all that remain

